PROLOGUE:  [For a description of the character's background, please see
Order of the Stick at http://www.giantitp.com/comics/oots0397.htm ]

A beautiful day in Azure city ... but for one small problem.

Sabine: "We have a problem, Nale."

Nale: "What's that?"

Sabine: "There's been an accident. There's no more ice cream in the
city. NONE."

Nale: "Yipes! Then that means ...."

Thag: "Oh, lovely sprinkles! Thag hold off boredom-driven rampage only
for you!"

Sabine: "We've got to distract him somehow ..."

Nale: "Not to worry, I have a plan. Thag?  I can get you as much ice
cream as you could ever want."

Thag: "Where?"

Nale: "Follow me".

[Four hours later, outside the Mazes of Menace]

Nale: "Somewhere down there, Thag, is the bad, bad man who stole your
ice cream.  They call him the Wizard of Yendor."

Thag: THAG SMASH STINKING GIRLY-MAN WIZARD!

Nale: "So all you need to do is go down there, kill the wizard, and
bring me this thing ... looks like this ... *Holds up a cheap, plastic
imitation of the Amulet of Yendor*"

Thag: What that do?

Nale: It will let me give you all the ice cream you ever wanted.

Thag: THAG SMASH WIZARD AND GET AMULET!  THAG RESCUE ICE CREAM AND MAKE
WORLD HAPPY PLACE!

And so it was Thag, armed with a battle-axe, a short-sword and an
orcish ring mail, when charging into the Dungeons of Doom ...

Sabine:  You know, he hasn't got a chance of getting it.
Nale: I know, but I'm sure he's far too tough to get killed.  It'll
serve as a distraction until we can find something else for him to do.
Then we'll get a wizard to bring him out.

